<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Fastly reload and get your weapons in your hands!</Major>
    <Description>This macro basicly doing a reload and fastly getting weapons. Its mean you can click a button and it will be reload, fastly doing 2-1 around numbers and getting weapon fastly. Thats mean you are not losing seconds with reload animation!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 21 1
Delay 104 ms
KeyUp 21 1
Delay 1511 ms
KeyDown 31 1
Delay 65 ms
KeyDown 30 1
Delay 19 ms
KeyUp 31 1
Delay 28 ms
KeyUp 30 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Counter-Strike 2</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>